notes.notes:
- Rebalancing of receiving points (now there are fewer of them);
- The second season is launched: the table of records has been updated;
- Fixed a bug due to which the combo was reset when changing music;
- Fixed a bug with "Regeneration 2"

A small but useful update for the game.

What's new:
- It is now possible to control the ship on the stick, not just on the d-pad (gamepad);
- Changes in balance. The game has become easier at all levels of difficulty;
- Improved support for gamepads (previously there were problems if more than one gamepad is connected to PC);
- Improved performance in Endless Mode;
- Fixed small bugs and misprints;
- Added message about possibility to upload your tracks to the game folder.
